    slug: 'parts-inventory-tracking-irrigation-business-software',
    title: 'Parts and Inventory Tracking in Irrigation Business Software',
    description: 'How parts and inventory tracking in irrigation business software keeps trucks stocked, captures every billable part, and prevents the stockouts that delay sprinkler jobs.',
    date: '2025-12-01',
