    title: 'Automated Rescheduling for Weather in Irrigation Scheduling Software',
    description: 'How automated weather rescheduling in irrigation scheduling software protects sprinkler crews from washed-out days and keeps the calendar full despite rain delays.',
    date: '2025-07-01',
